# Fault injection: the signature of Array.prototype.push declares 0 as its only result.
# The push is an inline attempt that may miss (TryCallInline). Its result arrives as a block parameter, so the check that runs on each operation never saw an operation for it.
# With testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime the result is checked against the type of the parameter, at the start of the block where execution continues.
# OPTIONS: testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime,UnderstateEffects:Builtin/Array.prototype.push/RangeOfResult
# RUN: run-in-shell mechanisms=all globalThis.id = (x) => x;
